            "sid": "NUM 33:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baimukya ha rusozi Hora, baateera orukande Zalimona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaruga Zalimona baateera orukande Punoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaruga Punoni, baateera orukande Obosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaruga Obosi, baateera orukande Iye-abarimu omunsi ya Mowabbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaruga Iye-abarimu, bateera orukande Diboni-gaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaruga Diboni-gaada, baateera orukande Arumooni-diburasaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaruga Arumooni-diburasaimu, bateera orukande omu nsozi ez'Abarimu, otakahikire Nebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaimukya kuruga Abarimu baateera orukande omu byeeya ebya Mowabbu haihi na Yorudaani omukiikaro Yeriko; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orukande batiire haihi na Yorudaani, okuruga Besi-yesimesi, rwahikira kimu Aberi-sitimu omu byeya ebya Mowabbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambira Musa omu byeya ebya Mowabbu, haihi na Yeriko ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gambira abantu ba Isirairi ngu: Obu mu raayambuka Yorudaani mukataaha ensi Kanaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mubinge abasi b'ensi egi babarugize, mucwacwane ebisisani byabo byona eby'amabaale n'ebyagiibwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "museese ebiikaro byabo eby'okuramizaamu, ensi egi mugirye mugiikalemu, habwokuba ngibahaire ebe yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.54+NUM.26.55+NUM.26.56"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 26:54-56",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugibagane nimugiterra akaruuru, enganda zanyu nkooku ziri; oruganda orukooto muruhe ekicweka eki nikyo rutwale, mugibagane n'enganda za baisenkuru inywe oku ziri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu abasi b'ensi kakuba mutababinga, omuli abo aba mulireka bakaikaramu, nubo baliba nk'ebisigi ebi rukubacumita amaiso, nubo baliba mahwa agalibacumita embaju, tibalibaha businge omunsi ei murukwija kwikaramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkooku nateekeriize kukora bali, na inywe nukwo ndibakora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
